    <string name="pocket_set_guide_help">Guide does nothing on the PC?</string>
    <string name="pocket_set_guide_help_sub">What the Xbox button opens on Windows</string>
    <string name="pocket_guide_help_body">The Guide (Xbox) button goes to the PC as a controller button. Steam Big Picture and Xbox-app games react to it.\n\nThe Windows Game Bar only opens from Guide when \"Open Xbox Game Bar using this button on a controller\" is on (Windows Settings → Gaming → Xbox Game Bar), and with some virtual controllers it doesn\'t react at all.\n\nIf you want the Game Bar every time, set the button to \"Xbox Game Bar (Win+G)\" instead: it sends the keyboard shortcut, which always works.\n\nTurn on \"Show what a button did\" to see each press confirmed at the top of the stream.</string>
